to have won the Booker Prize twice—the others being J. G. Farrell, J. M. Coetzee and Hilary Mantel.Man Booker official site: J. G. Farrell ; Hilary Mantel ; J. M. Coetzee: .\\n\\nAmong Canadian writers who have achieved an international reputation, are novelist and poet Margaret Atwood ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Twentieth-century_English_literature\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d25\"},\"ref\":\"d25\",\"snippet\":\" ... List of winners and nominated authors of the Booker Prize - Wikipedia\\ndate: 2002-08-11\\n---\\nThe following is a list of winners and shortlisted authors of the Booker Prize for Fiction. The prize has been awarded each year since 1969 to the best original full-length novel, written ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_winners_and_nominated_authors_of_the_Booker_Prize\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"b7be26d3fdfdc72740181917e74ec29de5c9669cab0637bb6b1bc3574ad5d4ef\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"d9ed133a7924e69f1fb8eb5fdedf716b499601cfffdd50a7db346cc70355c014\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"International Booker Prize Wikipedia\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d25\"},\"ref\":\"d25\",\"snippet\":\" ... Midnight's Children also won a public vote in 2008, on the prize's fortieth anniversary, for \\\"The Best of the Booker\\\". In 2018 a special \\\"Golden Booker\\\" was awarded celebrating 50 years of the award; this was won by Michael Ondaatje for The English Patient.\\n\\nWinners, shortlists ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/